          "text": "2008: Python 3.0. Eleven years of two Pythons follow."
        },
        {
          "atMs": 12000,
          "text": "1 January 2020: Python 2 is sunset."
        },
        {
          "atMs": 15500,
          "text": "Since then, one Python, getting faster."
